Apply the inequality \eqref{ineq: subgradient inequality} with $\mathbf{x}= \mathbf{z}$ to get 
    \begin{displaymath}
        f(\mathbf{z}) 
        \leq f(\mathbf{w}) - \nabla^s f(\mathbf{z}) \innerprd (\mathbf{w} - \mathbf{z})
        = f(\mathbf{w}) + t \nabla^s f(\mathbf{w}) \innerprd (\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{w}).
    \end{displaymath}
